WEBVTT

NOTE Machine translated from English captions; target=rw.

1
00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:04.762
Ibikurikira, komeza urebe inyuma yijisho.

2
00:00:04.762 --> 00:00:10.928
Fata ophthalmoscope mu kuboko kwawe kw'iburyo kugirango usuzume ijisho ry'iburyo naho ubundi.

3
00:00:10.928 --> 00:00:15.450
Tangira ibirenge byegereye umurwayi kandi wegamire inyuma.

4
00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:19.972
Saba umurwayi gukosora intego yintera yihariye kuri

5
00:00:19.972 --> 00:00:24.494
itambitse kandi wirinde kureba urumuri rwa ophthalmoscope.

6
00:00:24.494 --> 00:00:32.305
Buhoro buhoro tangira kwimuka uva kuri dogere 10 kugeza kuri 15 by'agateganyo kuri meridian ya horizontal hamwe na lens power zero.

7
00:00:32.305 --> 00:00:37.238
Komeza reflex itukura urebe kandi wegere umurwayi.

8
00:00:37.238 --> 00:00:41.760
Disiki ya optique igomba kuza kureba mugihe wanze

9
00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:42.418
santimetero kure.

10
00:00:42.418 --> 00:00:46.040
Tanga igitekerezo cyuko itandukaniro rya disiki ritandukanye ,.

11
00:00:46.040 --> 00:00:51.002
ibara rya neuro-retinal rim nigikombe kuri disc ratio.

12
00:00:51.002 --> 00:00:53.980
Niba udashobora kubona disiki,

13
00:00:53.980 --> 00:00:57.460
hanyuma ujye mucyerekezo amashami yicyerekezo cya retina.

14
00:00:57.460 --> 00:01:00.905
Ibi bizakuyobora kuri disiki.

15
00:01:00.905 --> 00:01:04.350
Muri iri suzuma imitsi ya optique ni

16
00:01:04.350 --> 00:01:04.659
kubyimba.

17
00:01:04.659 --> 00:01:08.670
Impera ntisobanutse kandi igikombe cyo hagati ntigihari kubera kuba

18
00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:10.941
byuzuyemo imyakura yabyimbye.

19
00:01:10.941 --> 00:01:13.590
Capillaries nziza hejuru yubuso bwa

20
00:01:13.590 --> 00:01:17.192
imitsi yatwikiriye, kimwe na arterial nini.

21
00:01:17.192 --> 00:01:18.830
Imitsi irabyimba kandi

22
00:01:18.830 --> 00:01:21.620
hariho kuva amaraso make ahari saa cyenda.

23
00:01:21.620 --> 00:01:23.790
Ibi bimenyetso byose bihuye na papillodema

24
00:01:23.790 --> 00:01:27.783
kubera umuvuduko ukabije.

25
00:01:27.783 --> 00:01:34.970
Iyi nervice optique ifite intera itandukanye cyane,

26
00:01:34.970 --> 00:01:40.948
ariko imitsi ya neuroretinal irasa neza.

27
00:01:40.948 --> 00:01:46.072
Nibigaragara bya optocatrophe.

28
00:01:46.072 --> 00:01:47.780
Muri ibi

29
00:01:47.780 --> 00:01:51.689
gusuzuma igikombe cyo hagati cyaguwe no kunanura imitsi ya neuroretinal.

30
00:01:51.689 --> 00:01:52.340
Imitsi

31
00:01:52.340 --> 00:01:57.540
Kubwibyo, ifite igikombe kinini kuri disikuru ya 0.8, byerekana cyane ko ahari

32
00:01:57.540 --> 00:01:57.980
glaucoma.
